pi-codex-auto-review includes a TypeScript port of the execution policy
contracts and the guardian policy from OpenAI Codex, revision
a956835d020762cb2b570053af06f643a11c0ecc. The rule interpreter and evaluator
run as JavaScript; the upstream Rust library and binaries are not bundled.
The literal PowerShell lowering is a TypeScript port of the PowerShell command
parser from OpenAI Codex, revision 80b88a700e4300022fe1893ecca9b8376d0c85d9,
without its tree-sitter dependency.
